ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMr. Zhang is a busy lawyer, often works overtime until late at night. His old friend Mr. Li invites him to a weekend fishing activity. Mr. Zhang does not like fishing, so he tells Mr. Li that his wife arranges an important family gathering, he must attend. On the weekend, Mr. Zhang spends the whole day at home resting and reading books.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Mr. Zhang say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mr. Zhang says this because he does not want to participate in the fishing activity, but does not want to directly refuse his friend, so he makes up the excuse of a family gathering.\nB. Mr. Zhang says this because he wants to give Mr. Li a surprise, in fact, he plans to arrange a bigger party privately.\nC. Mr. Zhang just finds out that he is going to receive an important professional award, he says these to hide his success, so as not to appear too proud.\nD. Mr. Zhang previously promises his wife to reduce the workload, he makes up the excuse of the gathering to show that he is trying to change.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725364646238823,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e414d6006945d2806f40","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368532776,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:42:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ea5fac670c95401fa6875900320f1ec6"}